   "id": 56,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "CHARACTER ARC\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 7, CC 65 to 80\n   1 Arc stage\n   2 Role in the scene (short list)\n   3 Role in the scene\n   4 Which way they change\n   5 The lie they believe\n   6 The old wound\n   7 Fighting the change\n   8 The test\n   9 Slipping back\n  10 How the change shows\n  11 A mentor's lesson\n  12 The character they could become\n  13 The moment they see it\n  14 Giving it up\n  15 The first small step\n  16 Changing for show\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 7, CC 81 to 96\n   1 Others notice the change\n   2 Chasing a new goal\n   3 A promise to themself\n   4 Changed, but too late\n   5 The healer\n   6 Facing feelings instead of running\n   7 Picturing the best and the worst\n   8 Welcoming hard feelings\n   9 Depth of awareness\n  10 The healing arc\n  11 suite: Ends better than they began\n  12 suite: The fall\n  13 suite: The steady one\n  14 suite: Refuses to change\n  15 suite: The mirror ending\n  16 suite: Mentor at their best\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 7, CC 97 to 112\n   1 suite: The mentor's road\n   2 suite: Dark mirror\n   3 suite: Small steps\n   4 suite: The act that became real\n   5 suite: The lesson passed on\n   6 suite: The psychologist\n   7 suite: The hippie healer\n   8 suite: The enlightened businessman\n   9 suite: Loving the storm\n  10 suite: Coming of age\n  11 pair: When the lie is exposed, the crisis comes\n  12 pair: When the old wound is touched, they fight the change harder\n  13 pair: When the test is passed, the change shows\n  14 pair: When they slip back, their road drops\n  15 pair: When they fight the change with jokes, the laughs rise\n  16 pair: When the change comes, the posture opens\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 8, CC 1 to 16\n   1 pair: When a character becomes the spark in a scene, the plot takes a turn\n   2 pair: When someone is set up as the lead's opposite, the lead's flaw becomes obvious\n   3 pair: When a character is growing, the change starts to show on the outside\n   4 pair: When a character is falling, they slip back into old habits\n   5 pair: When the lesson comes back at the key moment, the test is passed\n   6 pair: When the mentor dies, grief follows\n   7 pair: When the hero sees themself in the mirror character, they understand\n   8 pair: When the mirror character clashes harder, the hero fights the change\n   9 pair: When they see it, they give something up\n  10 pair: When they give it up, the change shows\n  11 pair: When the lie grips harder, they cannot see the truth\n  12 pair: When a character sees the truth, the background stretches\n  13 pair: When they finally see it, the clothes change\n  14 pair: When the old wound is deeper, the promise to themself is stronger\n  15 pair: When they take a brave first step, hope rises\n  16 pair: When they step back after the first step, they slip\nCV-CC 5: MIDI channel 8, CC 17 to 32\n   1 pair: When the change is only for show, a test comes\n   2 pair: When others notice, the change shows more\n   3 pair: When others pull them back, they slip\n   4 pair: When winning feels empty, they see it\n   5 pair: When they break the promise for good reason, there is no going back\n   6 pair: When the change comes too late, grief deepens\n   7 pair: When a healer is near, they stay with the feeling\n   8 pair: When they run from a feeling, the cost climbs\n   9 pair: When they picture both outcomes, the fear loosens\n  10 pair: When they stay with the feeling, they start to welcome it\n  11 pair: When they welcome hard feelings, awareness deepens\n  12 pair: When awareness deepens, they give more\n  13 pair: When the healing moves forward, the inner voice softens\n  14 pair: When they're free, they become the healer\n  15 pair: When they face the feeling, the way they cope with shame changes\n  16 pair: When they feel a hard feeling all the way through, freedom is on the other side\nCV-CC 6: MIDI channel 8, CC 33 to 44\n   1 pair: When they feel a hard feeling all the way through, the storm inside settles\n   2 pair: When they feel a hard feeling all the way through, awareness deepens\n   3 pair: When they take care of their own body and mind, they have more to give\n   4 pair: When they stop caring for themselves, they have less to give\n   5 pair: When they help others, life has meaning\n   6 pair: When they leave the place they always came back to, they grow up a little\n   7 pairs: The arc engine\n   8 pairs: Finally seeing\n   9 pairs: Changing for real\n  10 pairs: The other side\n  11 pairs: The healing road\n  12 pairs: Coming of age: the moves"
   },
