   "data": {
    "text": "PERSPECTIVE & MINDSET\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 9, CC 33 to 48\n   1 Whose good they see\n   2 Ready to change their mind\n   3 Closed mindset to Widening mindset\n   4 How the belief shows\n   5 Blind spot\n   6 Talking themselves into it\n   7 Misreading someone\n   8 Seeing signs everywhere\n   9 The role they cast themself in\n  10 All or nothing thinking\n  11 A parent's voice in their head\n  12 Overthinking or acting on instinct\n  13 Expecting the worst\n  14 Replaying the moment\n  15 Peace or chaos inside\n  16 How they talk to themselves\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 9, CC 49 to 64\n   1 How they soothe themselves\n   2 Laugh it off or beat themselves up\n   3 Comfortable being alone\n   4 The hurdle inside them\n   5 Taking care of their own body and mind\n   6 suite: Closed mind\n   7 suite: The circle widens\n   8 suite: Cannot see it\n   9 suite: Slippery slope\n  10 suite: Omens\n  11 suite: Stuck in their head\n  12 suite: The critic inside\n  13 suite: The hero of their own story\n  14 suite: The inner storm\n  15 suite: At home in themselves\n  16 suite: The numbing loner\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 9, CC 65 to 80\n   1 pair: When a belief is challenged hard, the mindset opens\n   2 pair: When a character starts caring about the whole world, what they want lines up with what they need\n   3 pair: When a belief turns into a big choice, the character changes\n   4 pair: When the blind spot grows, they misread people\n   5 pair: When the blind spot opens in one blow, they see it all\n   6 pair: When they strike back at a misread friend, things get worse\n   7 pair: When the excuses grow stronger, they slip back\n   8 pair: When they talk themselves into cruelty, there is no going back\n   9 pair: When they believe the signs more, dread grows\n  10 pair: When they live by the signs, their mind closes\n  11 pair: When they cling to their role, the lie they believe grows\n  12 pair: When they cast themself as the victim, resentment grows\n  13 pair: When they think in black and white, they misread people\n  14 pair: When the voice in their head puts them down, shame grows\n  15 pair: When they talk back to the voice for good, the change shows\n  16 pair: When they freeze by thinking, they replay it later\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 9, CC 81 to 96\n   1 pair: When they imagine the worst, dread fills the scene\n   2 pair: When it turns out much better, relief floods in\n   3 pair: When they keep replaying it, guilt grows\n   4 pair: When the chaos inside rises, the inner voice turns cruel\n   5 pair: When the inner voice is cruel, they beat themselves up\n   6 pair: When they laugh at themselves, the storm settles\n   7 pair: When the soothing works, they come back to calm\n   8 pair: When they can't bear being alone, they reach for relief\n   9 pair: When the chaos inside rises, the inner hurdle grows\n  10 pair: When the inner hurdle is cleared, life starts climbing\n  11 pairs: Caring wider leads to change\n  12 pairs: Talked into it\n  13 pairs: The voice in the head\n  14 pairs: Thinking traps\n  15 pairs: The spiral alone\n  16 pairs: Finding calm"
   },
