   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "AUDIO MIX\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 10, CC 81 to 96\n   1 Music under speech\n   2 Audio fades\n   3 Voice effect\n   4 Edited-in sound hits\n   5 Loudness\n   6 Voice-over\n   7 Translated voice\n   8 Voice cleanup\n   9 Music sting\n  10 Sound roles\n  11 Handmade sounds\n  12 Background sound of the place\n  13 Hearing through their ears\n  14 Echo of the place\n  15 suite: Hazy memory\n  16 suite: Dubbed foreign film\nCV-CC 2: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 10, CC 97 to 112\n   1 suite: Clean interview sound\n   2 suite: Inside their head\n   3 suite: Handmade sound world\n   4 suite: Shell-shocked\n   5 pair: When the joke pays off, a sound hit lands\n   6 pair: When the clip slows down, the music rises\n   7 pair: When the clip rewinds, a sound hit plays\n   8 pair: When a cutaway covers the talking, the music sits under\n   9 pair: When a scene ends on a button joke, a sting hits\n  10 pair: When the joke pays off, a music sting lands\n  11 pair: When the multicam switches on the speaker, dialogue leads the mix\n  12 pair: When a running montage rides above the story, the music leads\n  13 pair: When the voice-over is caught out by the picture, the scene turns funny\n  14 pair: When a voice echoes, the moment feels like a dream or a memory\n  15 pair: When a voice is translated, the mouths stop matching the words\n  16 pair: When the ears ring, the background falls away\nCV-CC 3: PORT 2 (your second cable), MIDI channel 11, CC 1 to 10\n   1 pair: When dread builds, the background sound goes quiet\n   2 pair: When the handmade sounds are exaggerated, the sound turns cartoony\n   3 pair: When the footsteps are singled out, we listen beyond the frame\n   4 pair: When the place echoes more, loneliness grows\n   5 pair: When the echo sounds like a cathedral, awe rises\n   6 pair: When there is no music, the sound of the place fills in\n   7 pair: When the hero tells the story in voice-over, the truth gets murkier\n   8 pair: When the scare hits, the sound slams to its loudest\n   9 pair: When every tiny action gets a whoosh or a thud, the cuts snap harder\n  10 pairs: The world goes quiet"
